Modifications
=============
This repository contains a TerraMaster TOS6/TOS7 wrapper around the official
Poznote Docker images (https://github.com/timothepoznanski/poznote). The
application itself is not bundled: the images
    ghcr.io/timothepoznanski/poznote
    ghcr.io/timothepoznanski/poznote-mcp
are pulled on the NAS at first start. The packaging adds the TOS service script,
the desktop module page (webui.bz2) and the Go control panel; nothing was
removed from or added to the upstream application.

